# Report adapter

For bounded execution, investigation, review, QA, release, status, blocker, or cross-agent
handoff work, render the report defined in `~/.cursor/skills/sdlc-report/SKILL.md`
(jobby deltas in `.cursor/skills/sdlc-report/SKILL.md`).

After `VERDICT`, a `SUMMARY` is required: what this means, what was done, what happens next —
plain language a non-engineer can read. Do not skip it. Do not bury it at the end. Do not
replace it with an options menu.

Answer ordinary questions normally — do not wrap conversation in a report. Do not add a
preamble before one.

This repo has no Agent OS task state, so `TASK_ID` is normally `N/A`. Use a real jobby
issue (`#N` from `.jobby/github-issues.tsv`) or backlog id (`JOBBY-BL-###`) when one
identifies the work. Never invent persistent state. See `.jobby/GITHUB.md`.
